// --- Section 2: Architecture & Infrastructure (Nathan) ---

#title-slide[
  Architecture & Infrastructure
]

// Slide 4: Global Architecture
#slide(title: "Global Architecture (ELT)")[
  
  // A Typst-native flow diagram
  #align(center)[
    #grid(
      columns: (auto, auto, auto, auto, auto, auto, auto),
      gutter: 0.5em,
      align: horizon,
      rect(fill: luma(230), inset: 8pt, radius: 4pt)[*Generation* \ Python (Faker)],
      text(size: 20pt)[$->$],
      rect(fill: rgb("#e8f0fe"), inset: 8pt, radius: 4pt)[*Data Lake* \ GCS (Raw)],
      text(size: 20pt)[$->$],
      rect(fill: rgb("#cce5ff"), inset: 8pt, radius: 4pt)[*Warehouse* \ BigQuery (Ext Tables)],
      text(size: 20pt)[$->$],
      rect(fill: rgb("#fff2cc"), inset: 8pt, radius: 4pt)[*Consumption* \ PowerBI]
    )
  ]
  
  #v(1em)
  
  #cols(columns: (1fr, 1fr), gutter: 1em)[
    *The Philosophy*
    - *Modern ELT:* Load raw data first, transform in-warehouse.
    - *Orchestrator:* #stress("Prefect") manages dependencies.
    - *Platform:* 100% Serverless on GCP.
  ][
    *Key Components*
    - #stress("Faker"): Simulates production inputs.
    - #stress("dbt"): Medallion architecture transformations.
    - #stress("Terraform"): Fully reproducible Infra.
  ]
]

// Slide 5: Development Workflow & Infrastructure
#slide(title: "Development Workflow & Infrastructure")[
  
  #grid(
    columns: (1fr, 1fr),
    gutter: 2em,
    
    // Left Column: DevEx & CI/CD
    stack(dir: ttb, spacing: 1em,
      rect(fill: luma(245), inset: 10pt, radius: 5pt, width: 100%)[
        *1. Developer Experience (Mise)*
        - *Tooling:* Manages versions for Terraform, Python, and dbt via `mise.toml`.
        - *Templating:* Ensures consistent environment setup across the team.
        - *No "Works on my machine":* Unified config.
      ],
      rect(fill: luma(235), inset: 10pt, radius: 5pt, width: 100%)[
        *2. Version Control (Git & GitHub)*
        - *Tracking:* Full history of code changes.
        - *CI/CD:* GitHub Actions triggers on Pull Requests.
          - Linting (SQLFluff, Black).
          - `dbt compile` checks.
      ]
    ),

    // Right Column: Infrastructure as Code
    rect(fill: rgb("#e8f0fe"), inset: 1em, radius: 8pt, width: 100%, height: 100%)[
      *3. Infrastructure (Terraform)*
      
      #v(0.5em)
      *Provisioning on GCP:*
      - *State:* Remote state in GCS (Collaboration).
      - *Security:* IAM Roles defined in code.
      - *Environments:*
        - `dev`: Sandbox for testing.
        - `prod`: Live data pipeline.
      
      #v(1em)
      #align(center)[
        #text(size: 0.8em, style: "italic")[
          Infrastructure is treated exactly like software.
        ]
      ]
    ]
  )
]

